{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1321417001:0":{"text":"ピーターさん、安心してください。足跡を辿って行けば、必ずお兄さんに会えますから。","source_cn":"彼得，别担心，跟着脚印一直走就能找到你哥哥了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E5C053D6FC4AC93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1321417002:0":{"text":"心配はしてないよ！だってお兄ちゃんは、公国見回り隊の隊長だったんだからね！","source_cn":"我知道，哥哥他一定会没事的！他以前可是公国卫队的巡逻队长呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6A2E5561042D9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321417003:0":{"text":"あの出来事さえなければ……除隊もされなかったし、臆病者なんて呼ばれることもなかった！","source_cn":"如果不是那次意外……他才不会被开除呢，更不会被大家说是懦夫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1799816EE648BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321417004:0":{"text":"僕はお兄ちゃんを信じてる！お兄ちゃんが何をするにしても、それには理由があるに違いない！","source_cn":"反正我相信他！无论我哥哥做什么，都肯定是有原因的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD97E94EDCFBB18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"ピーター","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}